<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1150] Table contents disappear 2nd run onwards</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1150</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Table contents disappear on a 2nd run of any SQL command in spark. This only happens for the table view and not for other visualizations.&lt;br/&gt;
Steps to reproduce:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Write any sql query such as
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;%sql
select 10
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Run the query&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Table will be populated&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Run the query again&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;No table results are shown.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Either refresh the page or switch to a visualization and switch to tabular results again to view the table.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;Firefox, Chrome&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
